        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-92, Traditional 3 Inch Ridged Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Contoured Lines Cabinet Door Pull has a 3 inch center to center and is available in 7 different finishes. Made by RK International,  it is made out of solid brass. The 3 Inch Ridged Cabinet Door Pull has a very traditional feel, but not one that is dated. Its timeless beauty will last through the years.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-92 Ridged Traditional Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
